5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,The morning bottleneck is the core issue. We need data on actual usage patterns before deciding allocation.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree on the bottleneck. However, we must also quantify the financial impact of any new infrastructure or penalties before proceeding.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,"I worry about fairness. If the same doors always get the spots, resentment grows. We need to check if current spots match actual bike locations.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@George Fairness is nice, but resentment is a fact. I’d rather know what actually happened last time things got ugly down there.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,I’m worried about who actually maintains the spaces! The last two jobs just vanished. I want to know the real workload involved.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,@Mio Maintenance is secondary. The physical congestion is the primary failure. We must prioritize spatial data over labor concerns.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio I hear you, but we cannot ignore the ledger. We need to know if the building can afford the proposed solutions before debating maintenance.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"@Ryuji The ledger is important, but it won’t tell us if the current arrangement is actually fair. We need to see where the bikes really are.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji Money is boring. I care about the social rot. If we pick the wrong rule, the lobby becomes a minefield.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka But if nobody maintains it, the spaces break! I need to know the actual paperwork and physical effort required to keep this running smoothly.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio I understand your concern, but we cannot solve a spatial problem with labor data. We need to observe the physical flow first.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka Spatial data is useful, but without knowing the cost, we are just guessing. I need to verify the building’s actual financial capacity before we commit to any changes.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,"@Shunichi I hear you, but I need to verify the pattern myself. I will check the sticker register and the morning departures to see the truth.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,@George Fine. Check the departures. I’ll dig into the complaint log to see exactly how the last dispute soured.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mio,,@Shunichi I’ll check the minutes and the ledger to see what actually happened before.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I will examine the morning departures and the rain exposure. These factors directly determine the physical viability of the current layout.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will examine the building account's two-year ledger and the treasurer's handover file on cash collections to verify our actual financial capacity.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,George,,I will examine the sticker register and the daily riders. I need to see who actually uses the spaces and where their bikes are parked.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I’ll examine the last year’s complaint log entries and the five years of association minutes. I need to see exactly how the last dispute soured and what precedents exist.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Mio,,I’ll check the five years of association minutes and the building account's two-year ledger. I need to see what actually happened before.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
